eam/apps/1033380/extras/01eb9a4b61cfac5205bca0679bd870b7.poster.avif?t=1759601017\" width=784 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/01eb9a4b61cfac5205bca0679bd870b7.webm?t=1759601017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/01eb9a4b61cfac5205bca0679bd870b7.mp4?t=1759601017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A Funky Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/3034089127507cea970a7d81d009acbf.avif?t=1759601017\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Different Difficulty Modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free Skate for when you want to practice your groovy moves </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lesbians, harold!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/1f24132293ea52ff2cab49892b948d15.avif?t=1759601017\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>",
